        "id": 89735,
        "name": "McBehrer",
        "username": "McBehrer",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mcbehrer/{size}/1850_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-02-07T03:54:22.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The only problems I can see are these: first, that the V5 don't scale with H; their attacks all do fixed amounts of damage and whatever else. It wouldn't be TOO hard to just put all the H values to H-2, but the other problem is that the Ennead are meant to be dealt with as a group. Their power comes from having a card play and having 3-9 auxillary effects trigger off of it, so having just 1 severely limits their ability to combo.</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:14:51.944Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
