      {
        "id": 89743,
        "name": "phantaskippy",
        "username": "phantaskippy",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-02-07T18:42:14.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>That could really work.</p><p>You get 7 red, 7 green, 6 Ankh, so Shu would heal all the villains 70% of the time, Nuit would regain health 35% of the time.</p><p>I would set (H)=3</p><p>Only a few are (H)-1, all the multi target damage is (H)-2</p><p>You may want the destruction cards to be set to 1 instead of 2 though.</p><p>It should work reasonably well.</p>",
